OL,7,     Fhe's missed during his time away,
OL,8,     Fand Lynda faces a shocking
OL,9,     Faccusation.
OL,10,G1215 Profile
OL,11,     FThe New Labour old boy was at one
OL,12,     Ftime a front runner to lead his
OL,13,     Fparty. But after a scandalous
OL,14,     Fresignation from Gordon Brown's
OL,15,     FCabinet, his political career was
OL,16,     Fover... until now.
