OL,6,     FThe Irish writer on her latest
OL,7,     Fbook, The Truth About Ruby Cooper,
OL,8,     Fand, together with presenter James
OL,9,     FCrawford, they explore the novel's
OL,10,     Fconnections to three other
OL,11,     Fliterary works.
