OL,5,G1700 Witness History
OL,6,     FIn 1944, as World War II was
OL,7,     Fdrawing to a close, the Mexican
OL,8,     Flove song Besame Mucho crossed the
OL,9,     FAtlantic and became one of the
OL,10,     Fmost recognisable melodies of the
OL,11,     Fpost-war era.
